[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) was marked as one known parser issue. The exported reports showed
two failures, so the desk tracked them separately.

## How the reports were split

1. Deduplicate the overlapping export pages by report ID.
2. Read date order from the tenant locale, not the browser-based intake tag.
3. Put booking-v3 form reports under the conflicting date hint. Put the remaining day-first
   tenant reports under the shared parser.

The desk notes that some reports looked like one-day moves. They remain with the cause found
from their tenant and entry path; they do not form another problem.

